Viktor's list for the Artist (08.10.2026): «a trash list in the room»; 10.10: «Доделай все мелочи по студии».

A third look in the library beside Runs and Gallery, «Trash»: the runs in the trash (the studio's trash/artist/), the newest first, each with when it was painted, its painter and pictures (small, from the trash), its prompt, and «Restore», which brings it back among the runs. The look is not kept (the room opens on its runs); trashing a run says the library's Trash brings it back; the list reads once and keeps itself through the room's refreshes. Lab 1310 lists the trash and serves its thumbnails.

Suite: 563/0 in the kitchen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
